:: Outpost 3 - Gate
The third outpost still has walls, guards, and people willing to argue over who gets through the gate.

Civilization survives, if only because someone remains willing to hold up the line.

[[Guard|Outpost 3 - Gate Guard]]

[[Square|Outpost 3 - Square]]

<<link "Leave">>
  <<run setup.enterMap("O")>>
<</link>>

:: Outpost 3 - Gate Guard
The guard looks at the sword, then at you.

"Keep it sheathed inside."

He looks toward the square. "Unless someone deserves it. Then use judgment."

The outpost has a flexible legal system.

[[Gate|Outpost 3 - Gate]]

:: Outpost 3 - Square
<<if $pendingTownWakeMessage>>
<<print $pendingTownWakeMessage>>
<<set $pendingTownWakeMessage = "">>

<</if>>

Boots have worn the snow down to gray slush.

Traders shout. Children run between carts. Someone repairs a roof badly but with enough enthusiasm to concern the people below.

The outpost is alive, and nobody here is quiet about it.

[[Trading Hall|Outpost 3 - Trading Hall]]

[[Adventurers Post|Outpost 3 - Adventurers Post]]

[[Lake|Outpost 3 - Lake]]

[[Gate|Outpost 3 - Gate]]

:: Outpost 3 - Trading Hall
The hall smells of wet wool, lamp oil, and coins that have passed through too many wet gloves.

[[Merchant|Outpost 3 - Merchant]]

[[Square|Outpost 3 - Square]]

:: Outpost 3 - Merchant
The merchant counts a stack of coins twice, then keeps one finger on the pile.

"Buying?"

[...]

"Then you are looking. That is still free."

[[Trading Hall|Outpost 3 - Trading Hall]]

:: Outpost 3 - Adventurers Post
Contracts cover one wall from floor to ceiling.

Missing people, missing supplies, and monsters everyone had hoped would stay missing.

There is plenty of work. Nobody here considers that good news.

[[Post Clerk|Outpost 3 - Post Clerk]]

[[Contract Board|Outpost 3 - Contract Board]]

[[Square|Outpost 3 - Square]]

:: Outpost 3 - Post Clerk
The clerk does not look up from the ledger.

"If you die on contract, we keep the deposit."

[...]

"You did not leave one. Good. That saves paperwork."

[[Adventurers Post|Outpost 3 - Adventurers Post]]

:: Outpost 3 - Contract Board
One contract remains pinned beneath a rusted knife.

Something has occupied the old storehouse beyond the lake.

The handwriting gets worse near the word "something." Whoever wrote it had stopped worrying about neatness by then.

<<if !$clearedDungeons.outpost3>>
<<link "Take the contract">>
  <<run setup.openDungeonWarning("outpost3", "Outpost 3 - Adventurers Post")>>
<</link>>
<<else>>
The contract has been crossed out. Someone tried to write your name beneath it and got close enough for government work.
<</if>>

[[Adventurers Post|Outpost 3 - Adventurers Post]]

:: Outpost 3 - Lake
The lake is frozen from shore to shore.

Fishing holes mark the ice in a line away from the docks.

A fisherman sits beside one of them, waiting for something beneath the surface to make the first mistake.

[[Fisher|Outpost 3 - Fisher]]

[[Square|Outpost 3 - Square]]

:: Outpost 3 - Fisher
The fisherman watches the black water.

"Anything biting?"

He lifts an empty line. "No. Smart fish."

[[Lake|Outpost 3 - Lake]]

