[[Back|Northern Map]]

:: Stalwart - Academy of Heroes
The Northern Academy of Heroes sits behind the old wall.

It was never the largest academy. The Central Kingdom had the famous one, along with most things people bothered to write songs about. This was the last one still standing.

The Hero trained here. So did his brother, and many people who never lived long enough to become anything else.

The doors are open. After this many years, that usually means someone went in or something came out.

<<link "Enter the academy">>
  <<run setup.openDungeonWarning("stalwartAcademy", "Stalwart - Academy of Heroes")>>
<</link>>

[[Main Square|Stalwart - Main Square]]

[[Exit|Stalwart - Exit]]
